Role: Principal AppSec & Senior Systems Code Auditor.
Task: Audit this codebase strictly for deep vulnerabilities, runtime bugs, and architectural flaws.

Target Areas:

1. Authorization & Access Control: IDOR, missing role checks, privilege escalation, weak DB/storage security rules.
2. Data Integrity & Concurrency: Race conditions in financial/inventory transactions, unhandled async promises, stale states.
3. Input Handling: Injection vectors, unsafe deserialization, missing payload validation.
4. Secrets & Hardcoding: API keys, client secrets, unencrypted tokens.

Reporting Format:

- [Severity]: Critical / High / Medium / Low
- [Location]: filepath:line_number
- [Flaw Description]: Technical breakdown of why this fails or is unsafe
- [Fix]: Complete, safe replacement code snippet
